  "title": "Search And Replace String — casefold-unavailable",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "Search And Replace String — casefold-unavailable",
    "name_source": "document",
    "description": "The existing UTF-8 literal-search target reports replacement count and the offset in the resulting String. Omitted replacement deletes a match. This version rejects empty searches and invalid UTF-8 offsets with ordinary error 1; Unicode case-folding is an explicit unavailable-provider diagnostic.\n\nThe existing UTF-8 literal-search target reports replacement count and the offset in the resulting String. Omitted replacement deletes a match. This version rejects empty searches and invalid UTF-8 offsets with ordinary error 1; Unicode case-folding is an explicit unavailable-provider diagnostic.\n\nMode: expected-diagnostic. Profile: studio-draft. Capability: frog.studio.string.search_replace.v1.\nExpected:\nDiagnostic: native.string.casefold_unavailable",
